Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.30,0:00:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.95,0:00:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我不在乎瓦里留斯摸过你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I did not care for Varinius' hand upon you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.53,0:00:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nor I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.43,0:00:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那个姑娘 妮维雅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The girl, Naevia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.61,0:00:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他说了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What did he say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.92,0:00:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,她死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.69,0:00:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,那奴隶贩子没说妮维雅已死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The slaver told not of her death,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.55,0:00:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,说的是她在矿区受苦受难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but of her suffering in the mines!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.48,0:00:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我站在克雷斯这边 一定要救出妮维雅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I stand with Crixus. And will see Naevia from bondage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.07,0:00:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去维苏威\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I move for Vesuvius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.16,0:00:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,想活命的 跟我走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Those that would live, join me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.53,0:00:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,尊贵的瓦里留斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Noble Varinius!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.22,0:00:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我向你们致歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I offer apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.63,0:00:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我的士兵们前去追寻更崇高的目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My soldiers have been set to higher purpose!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.33,0:00:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,进矿坑 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Into the mines, quickly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.34,0:00:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,此时此刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At this very moment,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.50,0:00:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他们已逼近斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}they close on Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.18,0:00:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事了 现在安全了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're safe, you're safe now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.36,0:00:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,克雷斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.26,0:00:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,带妮维雅到安全的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take Naevia to a safe place!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.22,0:00:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,《斯巴达克斯：复仇》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.05,0:01:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,《徒劳》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.80,0:03:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,妮维雅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Naevia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.05,0:03:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Halt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.39,0:03:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,从左面包抄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Swing around to the left!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.64,0:03:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我去追她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I got her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.99,0:03:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你害我好一顿跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You made me run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.52,0:03:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我最他妈讨厌跑路了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fucking hate running.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.26,0:04:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我要把泰科斯埋了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would see Tychos to ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.42,0:04:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不能落到罗马人手里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Far from Roman hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.46,0:04:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,追兵来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}More come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.93,0:04:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.85,0:04:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is no time for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.76,0:04:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,无关紧要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It does not fucking matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.18,0:04:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,反正我们就快跟他见面了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We shall all join him soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.09,0:05:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus shall fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.81,0:05:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这不正是我来卡普亚的原因吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is that not the reason for my presence in Capua?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.78,0:05:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,狗屁的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To shit with reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.66,0:05:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你的军队缺席比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The absence of your troops from the games{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.12,0:05:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,是对瓦里留斯的大不敬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}was an insult to good Varinius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.78,0:05:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我背离了初衷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Republic would bear far greater slight,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.99,0:05:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,是对共和国的大不敬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}were I to turn from purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.92,0:05:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,赛普修斯搜寻色雷斯人数月之久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seppius has been searching for the Thracian for months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.74,0:05:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你凭什么预言他会攻击卢卡尼亚的矿区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How came you to divine he would make attempt on the mines at Lucania?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.98,0:05:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,因为这是诸神的意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because the gods themselves presented it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.72,0:05:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,由他们的使者传达给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}through voice of humble servant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.38,0:05:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,露迪雅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lucretia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.96,0:05:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我的行动是听了她的建议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Her counsel moved my hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.58,0:05:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说倒是有道理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps your course was justified then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.31,0:05:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,但愿是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I pray it true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.68,0:05:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,否则就因为一个疯女人的胡话冒犯了贵人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Otherwise offense has been made upon the ramblings of a madwoman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.67,0:05:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这件事都过去了 伊莉西娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have moved past this, Ilithyia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.41,0:05:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,精神上算是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In spirit, at least.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.76,0:06:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那就来点实在的 举办一场宴会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us make it a thing of the flesh, with celebration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.58,0:06:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,就在这里 算是补偿你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here within these walls, to pay tribute owed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.83,0:06:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An excellent notion!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.44,0:06:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你接受吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well received, yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.30,0:06:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我要是拒绝就是自讨没趣了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It would stand the more grievous insult to refuse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.54,0:06:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我很荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You honor me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.32,0:06:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The honor is mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.16,0:06:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I only thought to help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.82,0:06:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,在我们家举办宴会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By plying that preening shit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.78,0:06:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,讨好那个自大的混蛋也算帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with celebration in our own house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.25,0:06:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们家在罗马 盖尤斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our house is in Rome, Gaius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.73,0:06:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要尽快回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I would speed return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.13,0:06:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,有瓦里留斯支持 你就能使唤赛普修斯的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With Varinius' support, you will have Seppius' men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.38,0:06:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,如今用不着那帮家伙了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now worth their weight in piss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.60,0:06:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,按照露迪雅所言 马科斯抓回斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When Marcus returns to us with Spartacus as Lucretia{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.86,0:06:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你太抬举她了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You place too high a value on her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.88,0:06:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦失败 她就害惨我们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She will drag us to ruin when it plummets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.78,0:06:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,露迪雅不断地证明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lucretia continues to prove herself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.22,0:06:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,她值得这样的抬举\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}worthy of such estimation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.99,0:06:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,希望我的妻子也能一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would that my own wife held the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.28,0:07:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.92,0:07:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,她需要休息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She needs a moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.84,0:07:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,她需要赶紧上路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She needs to fucking move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.27,0:07:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你长年累月在矿上劳作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How quickly would your feet carry,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.70,0:07:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你这两条腿能跑多快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}after months condemned to that place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.09,0:07:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不只是她需要休息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She is not alone in needing rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.41,0:07:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,体力不支 我们都撑不下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The lack of it sets nerve to edge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.51,0:07:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们找一块高地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We will find higher ground,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.43,0:07:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,打起来更好防守\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}better defended if set upon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.08,0:07:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你能再坚持一会儿吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Can you walk but a little more?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.89,0:07:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,她能行的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She will make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.12,0:07:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.92,0:07:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,带着她 我们的担子越来越沉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The weight of her increases with each step.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.38,0:07:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,也许是该卸下包袱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps it is time to lighten burden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.22,0:07:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我答应过克雷斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I swore a promise to Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.85,0:07:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,她是那家伙的心肝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She is the man's heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.72,0:07:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你还要让他再撕心裂肺一次吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would you again tear it from his chest?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.00,0:07:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,克雷斯死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.20,0:07:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我不要再管他的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I would be free of his woman,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.11,0:07:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,免得我们落到同样的下场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}before we fucking share the same fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.38,0:07:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去维苏威找艾力冈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We move for Vesuvius, to rejoin Agron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.43,0:08:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.53,0:08:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,再说这种话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Speak of this again{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.42,0:08:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,休怪我无情无义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the Romans will be the least of your concerns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.55,0:08:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,泰科斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tychos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.20,0:08:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,小角色一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One of the lesser men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.45,0:08:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,当作给他们的警告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let him serve as a warning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.71,0:08:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,让他们知道反抗罗马的下场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That Rome is not so easily defied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.29,0:08:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的人数减少了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Their numbers dwindle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.01,0:08:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,可我们的人手也在锐减\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet ours follow at more rapid pace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.55,0:08:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还是占优势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We still hold the greater sum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.14,0:08:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯他们都是角斗士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus and his men are gladiators.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.58,0:08:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你们这么点人根本不可能对抗一个…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A handful of your men would stand pale shadow against one{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.75,0:08:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,罗马士兵知道死亡是怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Roman soldiers know something of death,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.64,0:08:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,知道死亡的代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the dealing of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.06,0:08:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不要拿他们和普通奴隶相提并论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not measure their worth against common slaves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.08,0:08:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,奴隶倒不假\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Slaves, true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.27,0:08:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,可绝对不普通\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But far from common.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.10,0:08:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,调来其余的正规军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Move absent proper force...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.32,0:08:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,确保我们能除掉狠角色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and see the rank of the dead swell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.95,0:09:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在树林中的战线拉得太长了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your men are spread too thin throughout the forest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.82,0:09:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,只用派一个人轻装回程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A single man carried by swift purpose{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.93,0:09:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,就能带回大批的援军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}could return with reinforcements...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.32,0:09:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,通知各个分队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Carry word to the other squads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.42,0:09:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不许休息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We do not rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.91,0:09:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,护民官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tribune{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.68,0:09:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,搜查到底\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See this to its end{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.17,0:09:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,以盖尤斯•克罗迪斯•葛雷博之名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the name of Gaius Claudius Glaber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.00,0:09:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是敢跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Turn from your charge,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.91,0:09:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我他妈的保证一刀捅了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I'll put a sword in your fucking back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.51,0:09:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,瓦里留斯是最尊贵的客人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Varinius is a man of the highest regard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.42,0:09:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他的酒杯不能空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See his cup always full{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.85,0:09:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,满足他的一切需求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and all desires met.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.08,0:09:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,听懂了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Am I understood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.05,0:09:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 听懂了 - 是 主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Domina. - Yes, Domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.75,0:09:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你们先去洗漱和准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bathe and prepare yourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.80,0:09:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,赛皮娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seppia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.73,0:09:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 没人告诉我你来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies, I was not told of your arrival.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.55,0:09:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,没必要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}None required.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.74,0:09:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我来听取露迪雅的建议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I came seeking Lucretia's counsel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.30,0:09:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,似乎很多人都喜欢来找她呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A thing desired by many it would seem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.34,0:10:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你的话给她指明了道路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your words set her to path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.82,0:10:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.44,0:10:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你一直在赞美婚姻的好处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are forever extolling the virtues of marriage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.20,0:10:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,多年积累的智慧让我这样的小年轻不服不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wisdom of years has finally proven master over fatuous youth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.47,0:10:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这么快你就找到丈夫了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You've found a husband so quickly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.62,0:10:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,如果诸神保佑的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If the gods bless such a union.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.96,0:10:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我会为你向诸神祈祷的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall entreat them on your behalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.18,0:10:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,有诸神保佑 瓦里留斯肯定属于你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With their favor, Varinius shall be yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.86,0:10:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,瓦里留斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Varinius?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.64,0:10:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,他很英俊吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is he not handsome?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.66,0:10:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,又高又壮 还有钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And tall and strong and of means?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.20,0:10:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他是那种所有女人都渴望得到的男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The form of a man every woman longs to call her own!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.75,0:10:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他能成为无人可比的好丈夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He would make a husband to rival all others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.05,0:10:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去为出席宴会做准备了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I must prepare myself for his celebration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.54,0:10:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我要吸引他的注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would catch his eye,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.76,0:10:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,然后占据他的全部身心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and with it see the rest of him swiftly follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.60,0:10:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,她这样是受你的影响\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have made impression upon her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.29,0:10:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,还有你的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As have you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.93,0:10:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,人们不用千里迢迢去特尔斐朝圣了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No longer is pilgrimage needed to Delphi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.32,0:10:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,要得到诸神的指引\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Those seeking the consideration{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.06,0:11:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,只需要向卡普亚的圣人顶礼膜拜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of the gods need only bow to the Oracle of Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.49,0:11:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是诸神的工具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am but humble vessel,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.73,0:11:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,给他们的愿望添点儿滋味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}offering a mere taste of their will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.01,0:11:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那赛皮娅今晚尝到的会是苦味吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then Seppia shall find tonight a bitter draught.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.11,0:11:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,瓦里留斯是民政官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Varinius is a praetor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.70,0:11:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你丈夫也是民政官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As is your husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.71,0:11:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,但是瓦里留斯爬得更快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet Varinius rises more quickly,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.02,0:11:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,终有一天 他会成为执政官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and one day shall hold title of consul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.66,0:11:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这种人的妻子必须温文尔雅 处事冷静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The wife of such a man must possess refinement and poise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.05,0:11:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,乳臭未干的小姑娘根本做不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Traits yet lacking in a spoiled little girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.50,0:11:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你是要我祈求诸神 另谋姻缘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps you would have me petition the gods for a different union?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.57,0:11:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,更合心意的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One closer to heart...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.28,0:11:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,谁有这种奢望 那是癞蛤蟆想吃天鹅肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The morning cock has better chance of crowing to such heights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.73,0:11:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你丈夫并不这样认为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your husband believes otherwise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.99,0:11:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你父亲也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As does your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.04,0:11:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,如果马科斯没抓回斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When Marcus returns absent Spartacus,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.15,0:11:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你的真面目就暴露出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you shall be revealed as what you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.50,0:11:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,没有生命 不能预言的工具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An empty vessel, barren of life and prophecy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.71,0:12:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,穿好衣服准备参加宴会吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See yourself dressed for tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.41,0:12:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,毫无疑问 我夫君要把你当做爱宠拿去炫耀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have no doubt my husband will wish to parade you about as favored pet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.91,0:12:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我很珍惜你丈夫对我的信任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your husband's trust is valued gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.98,0:12:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我更珍惜你对我的信任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet yours would prove the greater treasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.06,0:12:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,列队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Line them up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.42,0:12:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有辜负你们的信任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The faith placed in me is not mislaid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.88,0:12:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯确实在我预言的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus proves where I predicted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.60,0:12:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,民政官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Praetor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.54,0:12:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你们抓住的人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is all that stand captured?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.46,0:12:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,还有很多死在矿坑里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Many more lay dead in the mines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.44,0:13:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,至少你的高卢人回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your Gaul returns to you at least.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.85,0:13:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where is Spartacus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.60,0:13:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他带着几个奴隶逃进树林里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He fled into the woods with a clutch of slaves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.17,0:13:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,马科斯去追了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Marcus gives chase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.86,0:13:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,看到他出现就立刻向我报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alert me the moment he is sighted upon road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.93,0:13:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,关进牢里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To the cells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.43,0:13:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.97,0:13:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,即使有你神圣的指引\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even aided by your divine guidance,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.36,0:13:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他还是两手空空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he stands with empty hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.92,0:13:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他会找到斯巴达克斯的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He will yet find Spartacus between them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.12,0:13:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,诸神…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The gods{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.65,0:13:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你所说的根本不是诸神的旨意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your tongue writhes absent their purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.90,0:13:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,妮维雅不是在我所预言的矿区吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was Naevia not found in the mines, as I foretold?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.48,0:13:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁把她赶到那里去的呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And who so condemned her to such a place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.75,0:14:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,朱诺吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Juno?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.63,0:14:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,还是世俗的凡人 角斗士训练师的妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or a Lanista's wife, more earthly bound?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.46,0:14:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你的预言不过是投机取巧的把戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your prophecies bear the stench of opportunity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.33,0:14:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,奥诺玛默斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oenomaus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.95,0:14:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是你亡夫的手下送来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}was delivered by your dead husband's man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.35,0:14:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙打伤人套出实情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A toad who has seen his share of wounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.51,0:14:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,没准他还能治好伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wonder if he could mend them as well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.01,0:14:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,别以为我跟我丈夫和父亲一样傻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not think me the fool, as my husband and father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.62,0:14:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们俩还有账没算完呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You and I have unfinished affairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.23,0:14:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,总有一天我们要做个了断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I would see them draw to a close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.28,0:14:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.70,0:14:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,又回到臭茅坑家族了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Again to this House of Piss and Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.59,0:14:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不该跟着我受苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A fate I alone should bear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.72,0:14:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道有这样的危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The risk was known to us all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.86,0:15:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,去他妈的危险 去他妈的混账罗马人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fuck risk and fuck the fucking Romans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.86,0:15:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我这辈子跟你混 下辈子也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I stand with you, in this life and the next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.23,0:15:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As do I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.59,0:15:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是兄弟之情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The bonds of brotherhood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.89,0:15:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,在高墙之内根深蒂固地存在着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They have always run deep within these walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.31,0:15:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,奥诺玛默斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oenomaus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.04,0:15:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,发生什么事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What has happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.66,0:15:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How did you come here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.50,0:15:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我做了傻事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was a fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.36,0:15:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不过现在有傻子来陪我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That now stands in fellow company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.05,0:15:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他们错在跟着我踏上不归路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Their fault lies only in following me on impossible journey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.92,0:15:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,妮维雅还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Naevia lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.85,0:15:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我们把她从矿区救出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We liberated her from the mines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.42,0:15:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,爱情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.32,0:15:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你因为爱情而毁灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You fall to ruin for love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.26,0:15:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,她是我的全部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She is my heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.79,0:16:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,她只是个女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She is a woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.00,0:16:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,再怎么说也就是脆弱的生物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A delicate creature at the best of times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.66,0:16:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,她们容易受到欲望的驱使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They are moved by desires unknown{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.93,0:16:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,男人一无所知 却还那么信任她们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}by the men that place trust in them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.27,0:16:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,她还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.13,0:16:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这才是最重要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is all that matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.37,0:16:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are safe now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.80,0:16:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,安全了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.85,0:17:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不去休息吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You do not rest?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.46,0:17:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想再看到有人丧命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not see another of us fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.17,0:17:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,就算诸神下凡 也未必阻止得了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not even the gods could have done more to prevent it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.65,0:17:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这想法可不能让逝者安息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A thought holding no comfort to the dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.61,0:17:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,妮维雅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Naevia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.85,0:17:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,李斯卡斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Liscus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.19,0:19:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,纳西尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nasir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.30,0:19:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他不顾一切地救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He risked life, to save my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.70,0:20:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,真是大饱眼福啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A most impressive showing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.92,0:20:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,难以想象前些日子这里跟坟墓没两样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It staggers to think this house so recently a tomb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.10,0:20:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这间宅子完全没有血腥恐怖的痕迹了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These walls truly present no evidence of witnessed horrors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.30,0:20:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这些不快的记忆很快便会烟消云散\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Such memories shall soon be cleansed from thought,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.84,0:20:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不会再来影响你的心情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}never again to darken mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.85,0:20:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我渴盼已久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I long for such a day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.32,0:20:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们纵情饮酒 尽情享乐吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us hasten it with ample libation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.20,0:20:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕一杯酒见底 蒙卡图就要不省人事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fear Mercato may lose himself in the bottom of a cup,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.44,0:20:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,忘记自个儿的身份地位了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and forget that we are of position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.46,0:20:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我绝不会出此洋相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would never make spectacle of myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.60,0:20:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那么来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come then!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.77,0:20:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我倒要试试你的酒量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would test the strength of your resolve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.40,0:20:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,还有我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And my own as well!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.00,0:20:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没见过加里恩努斯兴致如此高涨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have never beheld sour Gallienus in such high spirits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.50,0:20:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,看来这场宴会的确是明智之举\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This celebration already proves clever suggestion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.00,0:20:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,如有斯巴达克斯被捕的消息 那就更好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To be made brilliant, if Spartacus' capture were to be announced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.80,0:21:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,有诸神庇佑 今晚可能有意外的惊喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The gods may yet bless us this night with unexpected gifts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.70,0:21:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那就用美酒与欢歌向诸神祈祷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us entreat them with wine and song!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.67,0:21:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们的声音传至奥林匹斯山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our voices to carry to Olympus itself!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.85,0:21:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这间宅子以前距离奥林匹斯很近呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This house once sat perched within its reach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.25,0:21:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候我亲自到此朝拜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have worshipped here myself upon occasion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.80,0:21:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,科萨特斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good Cossutius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.90,0:21:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你竟然也到卡普亚来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had not heard you were in Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.53,0:21:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,他来看我的角斗比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He comes for my games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.50,0:21:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,顺便离开罗马 避开某人的监视\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And to remove himself from the prudish eyes of Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.62,0:21:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,合情合理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Both just cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.72,0:21:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.86,0:21:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,共同欣赏吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us enjoy spectacle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.20,0:22:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,果真是感官盛宴啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Truly a feast for the senses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.24,0:22:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我都无法用言语表达了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even I stand speechless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.50,0:22:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那我该抓住这难得的时机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then I shall seize upon rare moment,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.80,0:22:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,礼敬各位贵客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to honor noble guest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.90,0:22:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,卡普亚的子民们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good citizens of Capua!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.80,0:22:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,前来这间曾受到诅咒的宅子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your presence here in this house once stood cursed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.91,0:22:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,证实了你们的勇气和信念\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is testament to your courage and faith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.56,0:22:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不仅是对我的信念\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Faith not only in me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.81,0:22:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,更是对元老院的信念\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the body of the Senate as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.10,0:22:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,元老院代表 敬爱的阿比努斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Represented by beloved Albinius{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.18,0:22:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,和尊贵的瓦里留斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and noble Varinius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.27,0:22:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们应该举办宴会答谢他的慷慨之举\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A man worthy of celebration for his generosity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.27,0:22:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他用角斗比赛消遣民众\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in providing distraction with games{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.72,0:22:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,消除大家的忧虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to ease troubled thoughts!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.10,0:23:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧瞧 他们多么拥戴你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See how they admire you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.40,0:23:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这女孩当真遵从了你的建议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The girl takes your counsel to heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.65,0:23:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,而我将以恶人遭报的好消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I repay your kind attendance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.83,0:23:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,回敬各位的出席\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with welcome news of retribution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.95,0:23:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我的手下带来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My soldiers return with news{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.28,0:23:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯即将被捕的消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of Spartacus'imminent capture...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.10,0:23:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,并提前献上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and offer in advance the lives{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.22,0:23:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,几个他最为信任的孽党残余\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of the few surviving remnants of his most trusted men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.70,0:24:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这些角斗士 这些奴隶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These gladiators... these slaves,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.16,0:24:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,正是杀害诸位亲人的元凶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}were responsible for the deaths of many of your noble kin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.21,0:24:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他们将用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And they will pay...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.94,0:24:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,血来偿还\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.92,0:24:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,民政官瓦里留斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Praetor Varinius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.27,0:24:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,因有要事 我的手下未能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pressing concerns forced hand in preventing my men{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.95,0:24:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,出席您的角斗比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}from presenting at your games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.60,0:24:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,为此我献上这几个罗马敌人的性命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I offer you the lives of these enemies of Rome,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.00,0:24:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,为我的无意之举致歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to balm unintentional wounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.91,0:24:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,杀掉这些畜生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cut the pig!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.37,0:24:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊 我们要见血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on, we want blood!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.89,0:25:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,很感激有此荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gratitude for this honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.38,0:25:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,感激你不辞辛劳 追捕恶棍斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And for your tireless pursuit of the villain Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.04,0:25:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,然而我无法接受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet I cannot accept.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.70,0:25:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我不接受 是因为这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I cannot accept because to do so{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.69,0:25:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,会剥夺本城市民应该享受的快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}would rob the people of this city of deserved pleasures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.21,0:25:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不要让他们仅因一人的荣耀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let these men not fall here tonight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.99,0:25:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚就倒在了这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the honor of a single man,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.78,0:25:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,让他们去角斗场 当着整个卡普亚战死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but in the arena before all of Capua!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.81,0:26:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,找到水了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Water!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.98,0:26:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,快喝点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.10,0:26:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这小伙子很勇猛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The boy fought well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.40,0:26:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,如果这是酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would this were wine,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.00,0:26:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,就可以送他上路了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to send him properly on his way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.50,0:26:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你说得好像他死了一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You speak of him as if already gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.90,0:26:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他说的就是事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then he speaks the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.40,0:26:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这问题我们谈过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have settled this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.80,0:26:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,理智一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come to reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.60,0:26:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,他失掉了体内一大半的血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is more blood upon the ground than yet within him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.61,0:26:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,就算我们带上他 他还是活不成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even if we carry him, he will not survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.51,0:26:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,反而留下血迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But he will leave a trail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.13,0:26:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,罗马人跟着就能找到我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One that the Romans shall follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.87,0:26:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能把他丢下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We cannot just leave him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.51,0:26:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,对 确实不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. We cannot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.46,0:26:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你想杀掉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You would take his life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.19,0:26:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是送他早点上路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would but sever dangling thread.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.63,0:26:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这是对他好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It would be a kindness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.87,0:26:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我不准你碰他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will not touch him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.48,0:27:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,那你来杀他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then do it yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.09,0:27:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,让他脱离苦海 就像你对维罗做的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Put him from misery, as you did Varro{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.14,0:27:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,克雷斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.35,0:27:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,更重的伤他都活过来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He survived worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.84,0:27:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,就是对战瑟奥科斯的那次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Against Theokoles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.07,0:27:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,如果用火愈合伤口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The boy too will live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.87,0:27:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这个男孩也能活命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If his wound is sealed with fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.35,0:27:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,生火会招来罗马人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A fire would call the Romans down upon us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.78,0:27:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们必须动作快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then we must be quick,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.74,0:27:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,在他们追来之前就逃走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and be gone before they arrive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.92,0:27:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,如果逃不了呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And if we are not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.82,0:27:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没有足够的人手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We do not have enough men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.38,0:27:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 是没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. We do not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.21,0:27:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你要找到艾力冈 把大家都带来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Find Agron and bring all to purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.66,0:27:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会尽快跟过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We will follow as swiftly as we are able.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.38,0:27:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕你们没那么快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fear it will not be swift enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.00,0:28:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,虽说如同待宰的猎物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Trussed as game awaiting slaughter,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.59,0:28:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的眼神还很凶啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}yet the man still eyes us as prey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.50,0:28:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,很快他们眼睛里的火焰就会熄灭了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The fire will soon be put from rebellious eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.52,0:28:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,正好给你的角斗比赛收场 瓦里留斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A fitting end to your games, Varinius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.53,0:28:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对让人记忆深刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It shall be a day etched in memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.07,0:28:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我等不及看到他们血溅沙场了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I cannot wait to see their blood spill upon the sands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.14,0:29:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nor I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.41,0:29:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,难道他们不该死在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet should they not fall here,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.39,0:29:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就在这里杀死了我们亲爱的堂兄塞克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the very place they robbed our beloved cousin sextus of his life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.13,0:29:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们非常怀念他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A man dearly missed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.32,0:29:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,如果今晚不纪念他的话就太遗憾了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is a pity he shall not be honored this night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.32,0:29:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,让他们死在整个卡普亚面前岂不是更有意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would the greater honor not be before all of Capua?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.80,0:29:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都是政客 对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are politicians, are we not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.08,0:29:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们各退一步吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us come to middle ground,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.04,0:29:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这样大家都满意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and see everyone satisfied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.85,0:29:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,选一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Choose a single man,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.76,0:29:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,然后拿他找找乐子 以此纪念你的堂兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and let us make sport of him in memory of your cousin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.46,0:29:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这真是再好不过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A most judicious compromise!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.92,0:29:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,可不止赛普修斯一人受到了伤害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seppius is not the only one who stands injured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.71,0:29:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,诸神注意到了露迪雅所遭受的灾难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The gods themselves took note of the horrors inflicted upon Lucretia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.50,0:29:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,并且从往生世界救回了她的性命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And pluck her from the shores of the afterlife{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.90,0:29:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,以传达他们的旨意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to voice their desires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.64,0:29:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这里原本是她的家族所在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Should she not choose what blood is shed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.59,0:29:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,难道不应该由她决定谁生谁死吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}beneath roof she once claimed her own?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.70,0:30:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,她承受的痛楚无人可比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She has been most sorely grieved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.40,0:30:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,如果没人反对的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If there are no objections...?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.90,0:30:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,谁有胆反对诸神的旨意呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What mortal dares defy the gods?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.90,0:30:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,反对的人只能引来诸神的怒火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Only one who would draw their wrath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.81,0:30:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,瓦里留斯刚刚决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Varinius has seen fit to allow us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.46,0:30:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们见见叛贼的鲜血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}a taste of the blood to come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.29,0:30:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,他们中的一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A single man,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.99,0:30:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,将被献祭给这间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to be sacrificed to this house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.68,0:30:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,曾经被斯巴达克斯及其走狗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}where so many lives were stolen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.69,0:30:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,肆意屠戮的宅子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}by Spartacus and his jackals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.70,0:30:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,由诸神通过他们的前主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To be chosen by its former domina,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.29,0:30:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,选出他们中的一人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the gods themselves guiding her hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.50,0:31:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,诸神已经做出了决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The gods have chosen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.31,0:31:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,就是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.70,0:31:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们应该抽签决定顺序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We shall draw lots,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.93,0:31:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,并且不可致命 延长游戏的过程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and cut but shallow to prolong the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.97,0:31:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,赛普修斯第一个来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seppius to stand first,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.07,0:31:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,以纪念他死去的堂兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in honor of fallen cousin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.75,0:31:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,老子操死你们这些罗马猪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fuck the lot of you Roman cunts!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.30,0:32:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不要以为诸神对你怀有仁慈之心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not think that the gods have shown you mercy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.50,0:32:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我暂且饶你性命 是为了慢慢地享受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I but delay your passing, so that I may savor it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.90,0:32:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我的命早就献给\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My life is gladly given.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.70,0:32:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,妮维雅了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For Naevia's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.39,0:32:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,她还活著\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She lives?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.69,0:32:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你是别想找到她了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Far from your fucking grasp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.31,0:32:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,真是好消息啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}News greeted with joy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.70,0:32:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我要把你临死的丑态告诉她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would have her hear of your final moments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.17,0:32:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你曾经那么热爱的竞技场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In the arena you held so dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.32,0:32:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那么多曾经为你疯狂的观众 是如何唾弃你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the crowd which once cheered your name spitting upon you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.43,0:32:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,而当你倒下时 那可不是冠军的身份了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And when you fall, it will not be as champion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.10,0:32:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,只是一个普通奴隶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But as a common slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.61,0:32:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,没有荣耀 没有尊严\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Absent honor and absent glory{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.21,0:32:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你的名字永远不会为人所铭记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and your name forever lost to history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.93,0:33:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,让他再说罗马人的坏话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let this shit speak now of Romans!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.52,0:33:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,第一滴血已经流下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}First blood has been drawn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.99,0:33:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,下一个是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who stands next?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.32,0:33:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,记住不要割得太深\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Remember, do not cut too deep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.72,0:33:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这样大家才能都享受到乐趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not deprive everyone fair turn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.22,0:33:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,瓦里留斯刚来这里没多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Varinius in town but a handful of days,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.81,0:33:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,就掩盖了你夫君的光芒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and already outshines your husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.02,0:33:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他确实风度非凡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The man does exude presence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.30,0:33:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,胸部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The breast!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.95,0:33:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,可你的心一直都向着盖尤斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But your heart was always set upon Gaius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.20,0:33:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我被这样的假象蒙蔽了好久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is a deceitful thing that has led many astray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.64,0:34:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不过年轻时的错误还是能改正过来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet mistakes of youth need not forever haunt maturity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.50,0:34:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你希望解除婚姻吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You would see marriage dissolved?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.26,0:34:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我无权这样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do not hold such power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.17,0:34:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,只能由我最信任的父亲做决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That decision lies in trusted father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.60,0:34:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,盖尤斯倒不是没犯过大错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gaius is not without considerable fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.10,0:34:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不过这对我们家族的声誉有影响啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet it would not lend favorably upon our name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.05,0:34:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你怀着他的孩子呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You carry his child,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.88,0:34:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,而且他也身居民政官的高位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and he yet holds position of praetor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.00,0:34:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,又不只有他是民政官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is not the only one with such title.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.95,0:34:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,看来诸神青睐更年轻的人啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It would seem the gods favor less mature schemes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.70,0:34:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这种事情不要再想了 我也不会再想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Strike it from your thoughts, as I have from mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.74,0:35:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他快死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is fading.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.43,0:35:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,找个东西让他咬着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fetch something for him to clutch between teeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.19,0:35:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,等我们做完\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When it is done,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.29,0:35:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,必须立刻灭火 离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we must smother fire and move quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.72,0:35:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我见过你这表情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've seen that look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.98,0:35:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,还有你内心深处的自责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the blame it inflicts inward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.03,0:35:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不该承受这样的命运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}None other deserve it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.57,0:35:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们的选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We chose to do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.67,0:35:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,即便是该死的李斯卡斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even fucking Liscus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.00,0:35:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,葛雷博不是派人来杀李斯卡斯的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Glaber does not send his men against Liscus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.45,0:35:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,是来杀我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He sends them against me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.62,0:35:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,大家是因为我才遭此劫难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And all suffer because of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.22,0:35:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.74,0:35:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is because of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.15,0:35:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我们才能自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That we are free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.41,0:36:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你们干嘛呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.99,0:36:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要给你止血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must close your wound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.28,0:36:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就有烙印了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am to be branded with fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.41,0:36:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,跟真正的角斗士一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As a true gladiator would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.23,0:36:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你早就是我们的兄弟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have earned your place among the brotherhood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.03,0:36:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,按住他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hold him down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.19,0:36:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,别喊出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not cry out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.49,0:36:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,灭火 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The fire! Quickly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.96,0:36:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,拿上剑 走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take my sword! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.00,0:37:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,来 该你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come, it is your turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.29,0:37:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我还没拿过剑呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have never held one before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.04,0:37:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我哥哥不允许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My brother would not allow it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.98,0:37:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那就需要有经验的人教教你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, then it falls to more experienced hands to guide you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.54,0:37:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.30,0:37:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你不太喜欢主人找乐子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You do not care for your master's affections?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.54,0:37:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am slave to no man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.98,0:37:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,但你对瓦里留斯可谓言听计从啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet you bow and scrape toward Varinius' purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.76,0:37:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,只是帮我追捕斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But aids me in pursuit of Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.36,0:37:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这事儿我同样办得到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would have done so as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.33,0:37:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,而且不会搞你的妹妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Absent attempt to fuck your sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.00,0:37:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,行政官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Magistrate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.04,0:37:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,借一步说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.60,0:38:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,把剑尖对准皮肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now place the tip against flesh,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.64,0:38:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,让你的欲望延伸到剑尖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and feel it part at your desire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.50,0:38:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.20,0:38:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I cannot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.81,0:38:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.80,0:38:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们尊贵的客人对生手的要求太高了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our honored guest asks too much of inexperienced hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.68,0:39:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,您夫人杀人取命真是毫不手软\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your wife does not shy from taking life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.00,0:39:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,欲望就要这样满足\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is how you sate desire,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.52,0:39:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,无论爱欲还是复仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for love or vengeance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.89,0:39:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,都要毫不犹豫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Without hesitation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.32,0:39:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,风景很好 对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is a sight, is it not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.44,0:40:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,俯瞰卡普亚全城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All of Capua laid at your feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.08,0:40:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我没兴趣看风景\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is not the view, but quiet respite{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.64,0:40:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,只想图个安静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}from celebration that draws me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.13,0:40:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我多嘴多舌 打扰您了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I have shattered it with prattling tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.86,0:40:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.60,0:40:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Linger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.16,0:40:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你家的高枝 我岂能赶走女主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not sweep you from perch once your own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.33,0:40:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我好久没有这样形容这里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It seems a lifetime ago I called it so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.78,0:40:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,光阴似箭啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Time flees from us all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.69,0:40:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,徒留悲伤 日日夜夜地折磨我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Leaving regret for what might have been churning in our wake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.13,0:40:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕我们是深有同感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fear we share much in such regard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.83,0:40:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,丈夫死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A husband lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.15,0:40:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,妻子…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A wife...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.17,0:40:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,切肤之痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dearly missed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.64,0:40:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那就想想高兴的事儿吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us turn to common joy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.47,0:40:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,朋友啊 女儿啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of friend and daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.36,0:40:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,伊莉西娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ilithyia.{\r}
