Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.69,0:52:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我愿意做任何事 伊莉西娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would do anything, Ilithyia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.24,0:52:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,弥补过去所造成的伤害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To erase injury my actions have caused.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.67,0:52:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你想起来我们之间的事情了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You remember what happened between us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.85,0:52:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我全都想起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I remember everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.01,0:52:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不要以为这么容易就能威胁到我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not think I will be so easily threatened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.84,0:53:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你又想错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Again, you mistake intent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.51,0:53:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,错在你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mistake is yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.92,0:53:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我要拿你的脑袋往石头上撞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will dash your head against the stones{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.27,0:53:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就像我对莱姬尼娅那样 - 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- as I did Licinia... - Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.70,0:53:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,就说你是失去理智攻击我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With tales of how you lost wits and came to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.30,0:53:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你父亲…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your father{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.11,0:53:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会为一个婊子的死而难过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Will not mourn the passing of a faded whore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.68,0:53:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他愿意解除你的婚约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He will dissolve your marriage!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.63,0:53:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是为了这事才向他张开双腿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is the reason I took him to my thighs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.51,0:53:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,说服他把你嫁给瓦里留斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To sway him to your cause of wedding Varinius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.11,0:53:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是这样希望的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That is what you desire, is it not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.33,0:53:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,就算是的 可我父亲凭什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even if it were, why would my father{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.69,0:53:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,听信你的花言巧语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}be moved by serpent's tongue?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.26,0:53:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,那是诸神在说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The gods speak through me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.64,0:53:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他认为诸神的建议充满智慧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He sees wisdom in their counsel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.34,0:53:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我是为了你 伊莉西娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I did it for you, Ilithyia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.23,0:53:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,为了你和你孩子的未来着想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To secure future for you and your child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.89,0:53:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望我们能重归于好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would mend rift between us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.16,0:54:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,弥补我当年犯下的愚蠢错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One torn by my own foolish hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.97,0:54:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,也许是我太愚蠢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps it is I that have been foolish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.48,0:54:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,居然怀疑有诸神庇佑的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To ever doubt such dear friend{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.21,0:54:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这么好的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}was blessed by the gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.38,0:54:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,美酒和欢笑确实有效啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Laughter and drink have done much{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.05,0:54:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,驱散了心头的乌云\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to dispel darkening gloom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.96,0:54:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.45,0:54:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不过明天早上恐怕我要头痛欲裂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But yet I fear shall see split head come morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.16,0:54:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你还满意吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You stand satisfied then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.28,0:54:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,非常满意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In all things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.76,0:54:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,过去的都过去了 我们共同展望未来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us set past aside, and look towards deserving future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.17,0:55:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这话说得太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Words of significant worth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.33,0:55:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 趁我们都还清醒 我们再去聊聊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come, I would break more with you before sleep claims us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.42,0:55:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我为先前的疑虑道歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies for earlier doubt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.32,0:55:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚的宴会确实大有好处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This evening has proven most advantageous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.32,0:55:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.28,0:55:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我都等不及明天的到来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I long to see what dawn shall bring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.69,0:55:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,维苏威\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Vesuvius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.10,0:55:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,多远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How far?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.55,0:55:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,半天路程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Half a day's journey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.75,0:56:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,带上纳西尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take Nasir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.88,0:56:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我尽可能拖住他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will hold them back for as long as I am able.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.03,0:56:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.52,0:56:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们并肩战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I stay by your side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.13,0:56:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,妮维雅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Naevia.{\r}
